<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 (262K context, 200 iterations). Resolved: out of 499, mean <math id="S3.T1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> standard deviation; pruners use single runs. Cost definitions: Appendix <a href="#A1" title="Appendix A Experimental Protocol ‣ Compress What You See, Not What You Say: Anchored Context Distillation for Latent-Observation Software Engineering Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a>.</figcaption>
