<a href="#S4.p2.1" title="4 Related Work ‣ Compress What You See, Not What You Say: Anchored Context Distillation for Latent-Observation Software Engineering Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§4</span></a>.
</span></li>
<li id="bib.bib5" class="ltx_bibitem ltx_bib_inproceedings"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_bib_author-year ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhang <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span> (2024)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">Y. Zhang, H. Ruan, Z. Fan, and A. Roychoudhury</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_title">AutoCodeRover: autonomous program improvement</span>.
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_inbook">Proceedings of the ACM SIGSOFT International Symposium on Software Testing and Analysis</span>,
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#A6.SS1.p1.1" title="F.1 Software-Engineering Agents ‣ Appendix F Extended Related Work ‣ Compress What You See, Not What You Say: Anchored Context Distillation for Latent-Observation Software Engineering Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§F.1</span></a>.
</span></li>
<li id="bib.bib43" class="ltx_bibitem ltx_bib_misc"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_bib_author-year ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Ziegler <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span> (2019)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">D. M. Ziegler, N. Stiennon, J. Wu, T. B. Brown, A. Radford, D. Amodei, P. Christiano, and G. Irving</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_title">Fine-tuning language models from human preferences</span>.
